S:Ekor Anders
N:Från https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5bAPWrbRp9Y
N:"Something I've been playing for long time now. This polska is after Ekor Anders Andersson (1898 - 1983). He had many fun and interesting tunes. Sollerön is a big island, it's also inhabited. It's located in the beautiful lake Siljan in Dalarna (formed after a major impact of a prehistoric meteorite). I play the tune here in a somewhat free tempo, so here is a link to some sheet music I found to help you get where the beat of the bar is: https://www.jollybob.se/Database/note/solleropolskan.pdf"
N:Se även https://www.jollybob.se/Lat?id=131
